==Finnish==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|fi|urj-fin-pro|*rutto}}. Originally an adjective meaning "fast, quick, short-tempered"; originally plague was {{m|fi|ruttotauti}}, a disease that spread quickly. Cognate with {{cog|et|ruttu||quickly}}, {{cog|krl|rutto||quick-tempered, quick}}, {{cog|vot|rutto||hurry}}.

